(What it does) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 48.00 592.00 Tm
(- Connects data sources: Google Drive, Dropbox, OneDrive/SharePoint, Box, Notion,) Tj
1 0 0 1 48.00 580.00 Tm
(  GitHub, S3/SFTP, web crawl, and file uploads.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48.00 568.00 Tm
(- Parses many formats \(PDF, DOCX, code, Markdown, HTML, CSV, images, email\).) Tj
1 0 0 1 48.00 556.00 Tm
