1 0 0 1 48.00 500.00 Tm
(How it works) Tj
/F1 10 Tf
1 0 0 1 48.00 484.00 Tm
(- Frontend: Next.js 14 App Router \(TypeScript, Tailwind\) with Supabase Auth/Realtime.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48.00 472.00 Tm
(- API: FastAPI service exposes uploads/search/chat/documents; uses Supabase client.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48.00 460.00 Tm
(- Workers: Celery \(Redis broker\) queues parsing, embedding, and indexing tasks.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48.00 448.00 Tm
(- Parsing: document processor factory handles PDF/DOCX/code/HTML/etc with OCR fallbacks.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48.00 436.00 Tm
(- Storage & retrieval: Supabase Postgres with pgvector + full-text; hybrid search with RRF.) Tj
1 0 0 1 48.00 424.00 Tm
(- Data flow: Sources/Uploads -> Connectors -> Parsing -> Embeddings -> Index -> Search/Chat.) Tj
